                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "988dd4f2-1817-3381-bc78-6dc1e7240cee",
                        "entry_id": "cb579fd4-633f-37ad-81c3-4055ca6c747a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "лингв. показатель при существительном, выражающий грамматическое значение определенности (артикль, местоименное прилагательное)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d0aab6b3-ff5c-3761-9bf5-a571351d4d37",
                        "entry_id": "cb579fd4-633f-37ad-81c3-4055ca6c747a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "лингв. элемент суффиксального типа, тесно сросшийся с корнем и формирующий основу, отличие которого от корня удается установить только с помощью исторического анализа языка"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "44d08e73-bad1-340d-9986-be99a12da1c6",
                        "entry_id": "cb579fd4-633f-37ad-81c3-4055ca6c747a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "лингв. не произносимый элемент иероглифического письма, первоначально обозначавший принадлежность обозначаемого им понятия к определенным смысловым группам, теперь частично сохранивший свое значение (в египетской, хеттской, шумерской иероглифике)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5852172d-9522-4a5b-869c-215c0b8a1803",
                        "source_entry_id": "cb579fd4-633f-37ad-81c3-4055ca6c747a",
                        "target_lang_word": "determinative",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "determinative",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0cc9d572-4f3d-374c-a56e-8926c3a9703c",
                                        "entry_id": "c220d6b5-a487-3c5e-a74d-f3fc1d8130e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An ideogram used to mark semantic categories of words in logographic scripts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff7d56a3-745a-39f7-8ddb-148b09f7733f",
                                        "entry_id": "c220d6b5-a487-3c5e-a74d-f3fc1d8130e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of a class of words functioning in a noun phrase to identify or distinguish a referent without describing or modifying it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "determinative",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc41272f-5b5f-3ef1-851b-82fb680f1e6a",
                                        "entry_id": "5158f2c0-ba83-339e-b4a8-93ca00a6fc64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That determines something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b1239d14-a381-3c86-bea0-13288daf20a1",
                                        "entry_id": "5158f2c0-ba83-339e-b4a8-93ca00a6fc64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sufficient to decide something (such as a question of fact or of law)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a892a27-2efe-41bb-861e-8a52fb7d5824",
                                                "sense_id": "b1239d14-a381-3c86-bea0-13288daf20a1",
                                                "text": "When assigning custody, the preference of the child will be considered, but it is not determinative."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37386163-0a7c-4a4d-ad3f-a6464d7c3c56",
                                                "sense_id": "b1239d14-a381-3c86-bea0-13288daf20a1",
                                                "text": "This proceeding, though not presenting questions difficult of determination, or points of law that are novel, is unusual in many of its features, and is important as determinative of the disposition and welfare of a number of little children, ignorant of the contest that is being carried on in regard to them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f31d4aa-1bf9-4c1c-a047-67e20a91238c",
                                                "sense_id": "b1239d14-a381-3c86-bea0-13288daf20a1",
                                                "text": "It is therefore clear that, even in adoption cases where it might play a more important role, race is not a determinative factor and its importance will depend greatly on the facts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f43ebbf-9350-4857-bd15-1a3b45ff28c4",
                                                "sense_id": "b1239d14-a381-3c86-bea0-13288daf20a1",
                                                "text": "An entity does not automatically conclude that any observed transaction price is determinative of fair value."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bbbcdc7d-c184-465b-b5be-f8b0bea8c2e4",
                        "source_entry_id": "cb579fd4-633f-37ad-81c3-4055ca6c747a",
                        "target_lang_word": "determiner",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "determiner",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9504e63c-cedf-319b-aa78-f74bbfc701fe",
                                        "entry_id": "686bdcbe-dc4c-390d-a7c7-330528c02f9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone or something that determines, or helps to determine, something else.",
                                            "A factor that defines something, or one among several that define it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "974c854a-bc71-4e99-9c84-05b36213291f",
                                                "sense_id": "9504e63c-cedf-319b-aa78-f74bbfc701fe",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: definer"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31f0b0e2-9b2c-435d-a4d3-a9dbfd00fade",
                                                "sense_id": "9504e63c-cedf-319b-aa78-f74bbfc701fe",
                                                "text": "In quality management, the determiners of quality sometimes differ across use cases."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9103ef97-90d7-4377-8a59-c4f7433fe465",
                                                "sense_id": "9504e63c-cedf-319b-aa78-f74bbfc701fe",
                                                "text": "The \"steel-yards\" and \"measures\" were the only determiners of weight and quantity — as the hour-glass and sun dial were of time — possessed at first (so far as appears) by the passengers of the Pilgrim ship […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "84663489-2158-3df5-9d84-3655aea04171",
                                        "entry_id": "686bdcbe-dc4c-390d-a7c7-330528c02f9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone or something that determines, or helps to determine, something else.",
                                            "Someone or something (especially a sentient agent) that determines; a decider of a disposition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c506831a-1491-4ca0-bc93-13329e02d75c",
                                                "sense_id": "84663489-2158-3df5-9d84-3655aea04171",
                                                "text": "The software is the determiner if no input is given before the prompt times out."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "704fa524-b976-463f-93fb-cc6df5b50552",
                                                "sense_id": "84663489-2158-3df5-9d84-3655aea04171",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: decider, decisor, disposer, definer, arbiter, arbitrator, decisionmaker"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3e85424-9830-4d69-86d3-4e82756b82d0",
                                                "sense_id": "84663489-2158-3df5-9d84-3655aea04171",
                                                "text": "He is the determiner [usually referring to God (in theological contexts) and job roles (in administrative contexts)]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7961e6f-478c-4a08-a6b6-cfb7a04d4205",
                                                "sense_id": "84663489-2158-3df5-9d84-3655aea04171",
                                                "text": "Who is the determiner? [administratively or theologically]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e1ff242-19fc-32e2-a4c7-166b63cb6818",
                                        "entry_id": "686bdcbe-dc4c-390d-a7c7-330528c02f9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of a class of words functioning in a noun phrase to identify or distinguish a referent without describing or modifying it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f0d98f5-3464-4612-a6f5-155124feb309",
                                                "sense_id": "1e1ff242-19fc-32e2-a4c7-166b63cb6818",
                                                "text": "Definite articles, indefinite articles, and cardinal numbers acting as quantifiers are types of determiners."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07305908-b299-4ce1-a613-6a07d60fb56a",
                                                "sense_id": "1e1ff242-19fc-32e2-a4c7-166b63cb6818",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: determinative (broadly synonymous)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac838aa1-e712-33e2-b379-fa9811a37543",
                                        "entry_id": "686bdcbe-dc4c-390d-a7c7-330528c02f9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dependent function in a noun phrase that marks it as definite or indefinite. This function is usually filled by words in the determinative class but may be filled by other elements such as a genitive pronoun."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be8b89d7-f50c-4e31-8681-fcccd3abde4f",
                                                "sense_id": "ac838aa1-e712-33e2-b379-fa9811a37543",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: determinative (broadly synonymous)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "675b29b7-5cf1-465a-9c27-7119db39bc99",
                                                "sense_id": "ac838aa1-e712-33e2-b379-fa9811a37543",
                                                "text": "In the sentence \"Many people voted for him,\" the word many is a determiner."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
